# Bootstrap draft — procedures
# 111 novel proposals not yet in canonical YAML
# Review: promote (copy to canonical YAML), merge as alias, or delete
# After first-pass curation: 99 entries
# After second-pass curation: 25 entries

- id: 311_complaint_for_heat_hot_water
  name: 311 Complaint for Heat/Hot Water
  description: A procedure to call 311 to report lack of heat or hot water, leading
    to an HPD inspection and violation record.
  jurisdiction: NYC
  status: proposed
  aliases: &id001 []
  _bootstrap:
    sources:
    - https://www.metcouncilonhousing.org/help-answers/rent-control/
    sample_quotes:
    - If the problem is lack of heat and hot water, tenants should call 311 until
      an inspector visits and records the violation
    suggested_aliases: *id001
- id: challenge_mbr_increase
  name: Challenge MBR Increase
  description: A procedure for rent-controlled tenants to challenge a Maximum Base
    Rent increase by filing an RA-94 within 35 days of receiving the RN-26.
  jurisdiction: NYC
  status: proposed
  aliases: &id002 []
  _bootstrap:
    sources:
    - https://www.metcouncilonhousing.org/help-answers/rent-control/
    sample_quotes:
    - To challenge the increase, you must file an RA-94 within 35 days of receiving
      the RN-26
    suggested_aliases: *id002
- id: charity_rent_assistance_application
  name: Charity Rent Assistance Application
  description: Application to private nonprofit organizations for emergency back rent
