      financial assistance for the purchase, installation, and electrical costs associated
      with cooling your apartment.
    suggested_aliases: *id015
- id: hpd_attorney_involvement
  name: HPD Attorney Involvement
  description: The role of the HPD attorney in court, who represents the city and
    seeks enforcement of building and apartment standards, and to whom tenants present
    evidence.
  jurisdiction: NYC
  status: proposed
  aliases: &id016 []
  _bootstrap:
    sources:
    - https://housingcourtanswers.org/answers/for-tenants/hp-actions-tenants/
    sample_quotes:
    - The HPD lawyer represents the city. He or she wants to enforce apartment and
      building standards.
    suggested_aliases: *id016
- id: hpd_emergency_repairs_program
  name: HPD Emergency Repairs Program
  description: A program where HPD makes emergency repairs and bills the landlord,
    used in extreme cases of mold or related hazards.
  jurisdiction: NYC
  status: proposed
  aliases: &id017 []
  _bootstrap:
    sources:
    - https://www.justfix.org/en/learn/mold-in-apartment
    sample_quotes:
    - In extreme cases, HPD may call your landlord directly or even make repairs and
      bill the landlord for their trouble through the Emergency Repairs Program.
    suggested_aliases: *id017
