- id: letter_of_complaint
  name: Letter of Complaint to Landlord
  description: A formal written request to the landlord to fix a cooling system issue,
    often a prerequisite before filing an official complaint.
  jurisdiction: NYC
  status: proposed
  aliases: &id019 []
  _bootstrap:
