      the cooling system using JustFix’s Letter of Complaint.
    suggested_aliases: *id019
- id: one_shot_deal_application
  name: One Shot Deal Application
  description: A one-time payment from HRA to pay back rent to avoid eviction, applied
    for via Access HRA or at an HRA center.
  jurisdiction: NYC
  status: proposed
  aliases: &id020 []
  _bootstrap:
    sources:
    - https://housingcourtanswers.org/answers/for-tenants/housing-court-tenants/rent-arrears-tenants/
    sample_quotes:
    - A one shot deal is a one time payment from the Human Resources Administration
      (HRA) to pay back rent to avoid an eviction.
    suggested_aliases: *id020
- id: reasonable_accommodation_request
  name: Reasonable Accommodation Request for Air Conditioning
  description: A process by which a tenant with a disability requests that the landlord
    allow or facilitate air conditioning installation, including electrical upgrades,
    under fair housing laws.
  jurisdiction: NYC
  status: proposed
  aliases: &id021 []
  _bootstrap:
    sources:
    - https://www.justfix.org/en/learn/air-conditioning-laws
    sample_quotes:
    - 'A reasonable accommodation request involves a few steps: Prove the Disability...
      Wait for a Response...'
    suggested_aliases: *id021
- id: rent_impoundment
  name: Rent Impoundment
  description: A court order allowing the tenant to pay rent into an escrow account
    until the landlord makes necessary repairs, often granted in an HP action.
  jurisdiction: NYC
  status: proposed
  aliases: &id022
  - Rent Impoundment (Rent Abatement)
  _bootstrap:
    sources:
    - https://www.courtlistener.com/opinion/3159177/foster-v-britton/
    - https://www.courtlistener.com/opinion/4414807/m-c-v-texas-department-of-family-and-protective-services/
    - https://www.courtlistener.com/opinion/6315365/north-driggs-holdings-llc-v-burstiner/
    sample_quotes:
    - The court ordered rent impoundment pending completion of repairs.
    suggested_aliases: *id022
